---
config:
  theme: default
title: Data Export Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Backend
    participant MongoDB
    participant ExcelJS
    participant FileSystem
    
    %% Export Applications to Excel
    Note over User,FileSystem: Export Applications to Excel
    User->>UI: Click "Export Applications"
    UI->>User: Show export modal:<br/>Format: Excel, CSV, PDF
    User->>UI: Select "Excel" & click Export
    UI->>API: POST /api/export/applications<br/>{format: "xlsx"}
    API->>Backend: Export request
    Backend->>Backend: Check subscription:<br/>Free: 10 exports/month<br/>Pro: Unlimited
    
    alt Quota available
        Backend->>MongoDB: Find all user applications
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Applications array
        Backend->>ExcelJS: Create workbook
        ExcelJS->>ExcelJS: Create worksheet "Applications"
        ExcelJS->>ExcelJS: Add headers:<br/>Company, Role, Status, Date, Notes
        
        loop For each application
            ExcelJS->>ExcelJS: Add row with data
            ExcelJS->>ExcelJS: Apply formatting:<br/>Bold headers, borders
        end
        
        ExcelJS->>ExcelJS: Add conditional formatting:<br/>Green: Accepted<br/>Yellow: Interview<br/>Red: Rejected
        ExcelJS->>FileSystem: Write to temp file
        FileSystem-->>ExcelJS: File created
        ExcelJS-->>Backend: File buffer
        Backend->>MongoDB: Increment exportCount
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Updated
        Backend-->>API: 200 OK + file blob
        API-->>UI: Excel file
        UI->>User: Download applications.xlsx
    else Quota exceeded
        Backend-->>API: 403 Forbidden:<br/>"Export limit reached"
        API-->>UI: Error response
        UI->>User: Show upgrade prompt
    end
    
    %% Export Jobs to CSV
    Note over User,FileSystem: Export Jobs to CSV
    User->>UI: Navigate to /jobs
    User->>UI: Click "Export to CSV"
    UI->>API: POST /api/export/jobs<br/>{format: "csv", filters: {...}}
    API->>Backend: Export with filters
    Backend->>MongoDB: Find jobs matching filters
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Filtered jobs
    Backend->>Backend: Convert to CSV format
    
    loop For each job
        Backend->>Backend: Format row:<br/>Title, Company, Location, Salary, URL
        Backend->>Backend: Escape commas and quotes
    end
    
    Backend->>Backend: Join rows with newlines
    Backend-->>API: 200 OK + CSV string
    API-->>UI: CSV file
    UI->>User: Download jobs.csv
    
    %% Export Analytics Report to PDF
    Note over User,FileSystem: Export Analytics Report to PDF
    User->>UI: Navigate to /analytics
    User->>UI: Click "Export Report"
    UI->>User: Show format options
    User->>UI: Select "PDF"
    UI->>API: POST /api/export/analytics<br/>{format: "pdf"}
    API->>Backend: Generate PDF report
    
    par Fetch all analytics data
        Backend->>MongoDB: Aggregate application stats
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Stats data
    and
        Backend->>MongoDB: Aggregate hiring trends
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Trends data
    and
        Backend->>MongoDB: Get top companies
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Companies data
    end
    
    Backend->>Backend: Generate PDF using library
    Backend->>Backend: Add header with logo
    Backend->>Backend: Add charts as images
    Backend->>Backend: Add data tables
    Backend->>Backend: Add footer with date
    Backend->>FileSystem: Save temp PDF
    FileSystem-->>Backend: PDF buffer
    Backend->>MongoDB: Log export activity
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Logged
    Backend-->>API: 200 OK + PDF blob
    API-->>UI: PDF file
    UI->>User: Download analytics-report.pdf
    
    %% Bulk Export All Data
    Note over User,FileSystem: Export All Data (Pro Feature)
    User->>UI: Click "Export All Data"
    UI->>API: POST /api/export/bulk
    API->>Backend: Bulk export request
    Backend->>Backend: Verify Pro subscription
    
    alt Is Pro user
        Backend->>Backend: Create ZIP archive
        
        par Export all collections
            Backend->>MongoDB: Get applications
            MongoDB-->>Backend: Applications
            Backend->>ExcelJS: Create applications.xlsx
        and
            Backend->>MongoDB: Get saved jobs
            MongoDB-->>Backend: Jobs
            Backend->>ExcelJS: Create jobs.xlsx
        and
            Backend->>MongoDB: Get user profile
            MongoDB-->>Backend: Profile
            Backend->>ExcelJS: Create profile.json
        and
            Backend->>MongoDB: Get alerts history
            MongoDB-->>Backend: Alerts
            Backend->>ExcelJS: Create alerts.csv
        end
        
        Backend->>FileSystem: Add all files to ZIP
        FileSystem-->>Backend: ZIP buffer
        Backend-->>API: 200 OK + ZIP blob
        API-->>UI: ZIP file
        UI->>User: Download codecoast-data.zip
    else Not Pro user
        Backend-->>API: 403 Forbidden:<br/>"Pro subscription required"
        API-->>UI: Error
        UI->>User: Show Pro upgrade modal
    end
